-- and the claim a read-across adaptation actually makes, stated so that it can be checked: that
-- membership in the proposed group determines the hazard. Supplying this is what a justification is; the
-- measured record is that about 7.5% of read-across proposals in ECHA's compliance checks were found
-- satisfactory, and that 70% of the rejected ones offered a single similar substance instead.
HazardDetermined : BScope → (Mol → Nat) → Type 1
HazardDetermined s h = (M : Mol) → (N : Mol) → s M ≡ s N → h M ≡ h N
